    <informations>Shelly Dimmer Gen4 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: L L N O O S2 S1.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-dimmer-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_b1a44456685ced20fabd0bcaaab7585f29d6751dfeba4653f7aa83e425c990d7/Shelly%20Dimmer%20Gen4.jpg?cb=82ca107c562967281b79a6305de7dc32
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_8ab90e5d2638830b128d17c546983a44c3d8fdc4cdba51f4338b009e0159d93c/Dimmer-Gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=fc25336a974b8532f01248ceb6d8f54f
